      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِطَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَطَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَطٌ</span> (S, K) and

<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلْطَةٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He</i> (a man) <i>had little, scanty,</i> or
<i>thin, hair upon the sides of his face,</i> or <i>of
his cheeks:</i> (S [which indicates that it is like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرِطَ</span>:]) or <i>had no hair upon his body,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>but only upon his head and beard.</i> (TA.) ＝   
